    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About this Game</h2><br>Embark on an epic adventure in this top-down action RPG! Take on the role of Ned, a disgruntled demon employee seeking to restore Hell's former glory. Confront your resistant manager, battle the 7 Sins and Satan, and make Hell great again in this thrilling demon-filled quest!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Is This Game For You?</h2><br>Fire &amp; Brim Co. is for anyone who loves the classic top-down shooter experiences but enjoys a rich story with epic boss fights. The game features a unique ability system that creates endless possibilities and replayability.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Epic Story Line<br></li><li> Learn as you play<br></li><li> Hidden Easter Eggs<br></li><li> Ongoing Development </li></ul>",
